{"type":"Feature","properties":{"kind":"port_limits","cargo":[],"osm":["way/292702360","way/1065537950","way/336929295","way/334725252","way/334787342","way/334780863"],"source":"Derived: the convex hull of this port's terminals from OpenStreetMap, grown by 200 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it (the sea within its coastline, rivers, docks and basins), with the terminals kept whole","licence":"ODbL-1.0","reviewed_at":"2026-11-23","clip":"water","note":"OpenStreetMap maps no port limits for Abidjan. These are the hull of the terminals below, from the container terminals at Vridi to the fruit quay in the north, grown by 200 m, then cut to the water OpenStreetMap maps inside it, with the terminals kept whole and a 30 m margin where they meet the water. What is left is the lagoon water off the quays and the six terminals; the land of Treichville and Petit-Bassam between them is cut away. A scan of OpenStreetMap finds no homes, schools, hospitals or places of worship inside. Two residential areas reach in where they are drawn over the shore, by about 200 m² in all; the commune of Treichville and the island of Petit-Bassam, whose outlines take in the port, overlap it; and the named places inside are labels on the quays and the grain terminal.","inside":{"houses":0,"residential_m2":215,"residential":[{"osm":"way/393619937","m2":161},{"osm":"way/342714256","m2":54}],"amenities":0}},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-4.0123,5.277871],[-4.012231,5.277873],[-4.01223,5.277892],[-4.012003,5.277926],[-4.011951,5.277925],[-4.011942,5.277934],[-4.011899,5.283549],[-4.011755,5.283618],[-4.011753,5.283632],[-4.011869,5.283743],[-4.012942,5.283747],[-4.012946,5.284528],[-4.012955,5.284537],[-4.013352,5.284354],[-4.017667,5.284345],[-4.017668,5.284608],[-4.017939,5.284608],[-4.017946,5.28489],[-4.014196,5.287482],[-4.013871,5.288302],[-4.016796,5.289523],[-4.016214,5.290902],[-4.01246,5.289305],[-4.01151,5.291627],[-4.010423,5.291615],[-4.010421,5.291756]